{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026O5fROMiiUg1794557778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本千葉縣有養雞場發現禽流感，是繼京都府後本季第二宗個案。</p><p></p><p>千葉縣政府周五宣布，位於旭市一個養雞場，前一日通報死雞數量增加，經基因檢測發現十隻雞中，有三隻對禽流感病毒呈陽性反應，其後檢測發現高致病性H5禽流感病毒。</p><p></p><p>當局已開始撲殺養雞場內約四萬隻雞，並禁止該養雞場方圓十公里範圍內，49個農場、逾五百萬隻雞的運送。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:38:32.688981+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:52:19.616599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:31:51.388293+00:00","content_hash":"92edeaa44c9a7333fb39da3ff197f69bb928bc1ae012d2708b963b63c9f46576","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:38:32.688981+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}